      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">75 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 43 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Text Editor with Undo/Redo</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Asked as \"Google Docs in 90 minutes\" at Razorpay, as an O(1) cursor editor at Google and as plain undo/redo at Amazon. You build a gap buffer for the text, a cursor that remembers its column on up and down, every edit as a Command that knows its own inverse, word-level undo grouping, replace-all as one undo step, a Memento checkpoint, and Flyweight glyphs for rendering. Java, Python and C++14 code all run.</p>\n"
  },
